{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity survived the introduction of magic, barely. Now, new nations formed, each wielding their own magic specialties and adapting to the surge of magic and otherworldly creatures that have crossed over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Deck Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each mana type offers its own strengths and abilities; combine multiple types to uncover hidden synergies and craft your unique playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/c933cd72183b7b1722c581d59d369a03.poster.avif?t=1772791843\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/c933cd72183b7b1722c581d59d369a03.webm?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/c933cd72183b7b1722c581d59d369a03.mp4?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Interactive Card Abilities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creature buttons summon tokens, cast spells, and trigger special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemies with fireballs or toss enchanted fruit to boost allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip weapons, enhancements, or even dragon riders to unlock powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Guide your creature's evolution: choose between stat buffs or creature transformation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/175c2dea49770ddec50c4d04ca75826b.poster.avif?t=1772791843\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/175c2dea49770ddec50c4d04ca75826b.webm?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/175c2dea49770ddec50c4d04ca75826b.mp4?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All New Mana System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your castle's mana and special abilities each turn by selecting two of four generated support cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/ef34c4764cdc3f8187fa1cabfbef3223.poster.avif?t=1772791843\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/ef34c4764cdc3f8187fa1cabfbef3223.webm?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/ef34c4764cdc3f8187fa1cabfbef3223.mp4?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunyata</strong> is free to download and play, offering full access to all cards through in-game progress. Our rewarding system ensures that both free and paying players can be competitive and explore countless deck types. Every player starts with eight free decks, unlockable in single-player mode, and can earn booster packs through game play rewards in both ranked and draft mode, totaling over 400 playable cards!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603960?t=1772791843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603960?t=1772791843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/6c2f0d4ee2706babb4b0f42853ed4100aa55ea92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772791843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/6c2f0d4ee2706babb4b0f42853ed4100aa55ea92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772791843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity survived the introduction of magic, barely. Now, new nations formed, each wielding their own magic specialties and adapting to the surge of magic and otherworldly creatures that have crossed over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Deck Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each mana type offers its own strengths and abilities; combine multiple types to uncover hidden synergies and craft your unique playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/c933cd72183b7b1722c581d59d369a03.poster.avif?t=1772791843\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/c933cd72183b7b1722c581d59d369a03.webm?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/c933cd72183b7b1722c581d59d369a03.mp4?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Interactive Card Abilities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creature buttons summon tokens, cast spells, and trigger special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemies with fireballs or toss enchanted fruit to boost allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip weapons, enhancements, or even dragon riders to unlock powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Guide your creature's evolution: choose between stat buffs or creature transformation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/175c2dea49770ddec50c4d04ca75826b.poster.avif?t=1772791843\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/175c2dea49770ddec50c4d04ca75826b.webm?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/175c2dea49770ddec50c4d04ca75826b.mp4?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All New Mana System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your castle's mana and special abilities each turn by selecting two of four generated support cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/ef34c4764cdc3f8187fa1cabfbef3223.poster.avif?t=1772791843\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/ef34c4764cdc3f8187fa1cabfbef3223.webm?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/extras/ef34c4764cdc3f8187fa1cabfbef3223.mp4?t=1772791843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunyata</strong> is free to download and play, offering full access to all cards through in-game progress. Our rewarding system ensures that both free and paying players can be competitive and explore countless deck types. Every player starts with eight free decks, unlockable in single-player mode, and can earn booster packs through game play rewards in both ranked and draft mode, totaling over 400 playable cards!</p>","developers":["Nagarjuna Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603960/2ae5ca96237a02ee1adc3c7fdcda7dd1099debaf/header.jpg?t=1772791843","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/1887896400/67ba4286a9f9017bf4c77e2c03260dd24d6877a4/1771643176/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771643679","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/1887896400/67ba4286a9f9017bf4c77e2c03260dd24d6877a4/1771643176/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771643679","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603960/1887896400/67ba4286a9f9017bf4c77e2c03260dd24d6877a4/1771643176/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771643679","id":257280680,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257280680/7537ef2a2783315a2ab1f7180ad8156af17f72ae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771643679"}],"name":"Sunyata CCG","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><